---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Ghana Property Inspection Checklist" description="Comprehensive 60-item inspection with automated register, color-coded ratings, and cost tracking.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <a href="/products/" style="color:#516784; text-decoration:none; margin-bottom:1rem; display:inline-block;">← Back to Products</a>

      <h1>Ghana Property Inspection Checklist</h1>
      <p class="muted" style="max-width:680px; margin-bottom:2rem;">Comprehensive 60-item inspection checklist covering structural, electrical, plumbing, appliances, and external features. Automated register tracks findings, costs, and compliance issues.</p>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#f0f4f8; border-radius:8px;">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">What's Included</h2>
        <ul style="line-height:1.8;">
          <li><strong>60-Item Checklist:</strong> Comprehensive assessment covering all property aspects</li>
          <li><strong>Fillable PDF:</strong> Professional form for printing and digital completion</li>
          <li><strong>Interactive HTML App:</strong> Browser-based form with real-time calculations (Manager & Portfolio tiers)</li>
          <li><strong>Automated Excel Register:</strong> Track all inspections, findings, costs, and follow-up actions</li>
          <li><strong>Color-Coded Ratings:</strong> Green (good), Yellow (needs attention), Red (urgent repair)</li>
          <li><strong>Cost Tracking:</strong> Budget for required repairs and maintenance</li>
          <li><strong>PDF Guide:</strong> Step-by-step inspection instructions for property managers</li>
          <li><strong>WhatsApp Cards:</strong> 5 marketing cards (Portfolio tier only)</li>
          <li><strong>Offline-first:</strong> No subscriptions, works in PDF reader and Excel.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0;">
        <h2>Choose Your Tier</h2>
        <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap:1.5rem; margin-top:1.5rem;">

          <div style="padding:1.5rem; background:#f0f4f8; border-radius:8px; border-left:4px solid #516784;">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:#362622;">Landlord</h3>
            <p style="color:#666; margin:0.5rem 0;">Fillable PDF checklist for individual landlords managing property inspections.</p>
            <div style="font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:700; color:#516784; margin:1.5rem 0;">GHS 39</div>
            <ul style="font-size:0.9rem; line-height:1.6; margin:1rem 0;">
              <li>Fillable PDF (60 items)</li>
              <li>Color-coded ratings</li>
              <li>Cost estimation section</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="https://selar.com/0n237w0851" target="_blank" style="display:block; text-align:center; padding:0.75rem; background:#516784; color:white; text-decoration:none; border-radius:4px; font-weight:600;">Purchase on Selar →</a>
          </div>

          <div style="padding:1.5rem; background:#f0f4f8; border-radius:8px; border-left:4px solid #516784;">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:#362622;">Manager</h3>
            <p style="color:#666; margin:0.5rem 0;">Professional toolkit with interactive app and automated tracking.</p>
            <div style="font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:700; color:#516784; margin:1.5rem 0;">GHS 79</div>
            <ul style="font-size:0.9rem; line-height:1.6; margin:1rem 0;">
              <li>Fillable PDF checklist</li>
              <li>Interactive HTML app</li>
              <li>Excel register</li>
              <li>Cost tracking</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="https://selar.com/10e07c38m5" target="_blank" style="display:block; text-align:center; padding:0.75rem; background:#516784; color:white; text-decoration:none; border-radius:4px; font-weight:600;">Purchase on Selar →</a>
          </div>

          <div style="padding:1.5rem; background:#f0f4f8; border-radius:8px; border-left:4px solid #516784;">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:#362622;">Portfolio</h3>
            <p style="color:#666; margin:0.5rem 0;">Complete inspection toolkit with all features and marketing materials.</p>
            <div style="font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:700; color:#516784; margin:1.5rem 0;">GHS 139</div>
            <ul style="font-size:0.9rem; line-height:1.6; margin:1rem 0;">
              <li>Full toolkit + templates</li>
              <li>Interactive app + register</li>
              <li>PDF guide + forms</li>
              <li>5 WhatsApp cards</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="https://selar.com/bb4331eeuz" target="_blank" style="display:block; text-align:center; padding:0.75rem; background:#516784; color:white; text-decoration:none; border-radius:4px; font-weight:600;">Purchase on Selar →</a>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#f9f9f9; border-radius:8px;">
        <h3>Inspection Categories</h3>
        <ul style="line-height:1.8;">
          <li><strong>Structure & Safety:</strong> Foundation, walls, roof, windows, doors, locks</li>
          <li><strong>Electrical Systems:</strong> Wiring, outlets, switches, circuit breaker, lighting</li>
          <li><strong>Plumbing:</strong> Water supply, drainage, fixtures, water heater</li>
          <li><strong>Kitchen & Appliances:</strong> Stove, refrigerator, sink, cabinets, countertops</li>
          <li><strong>Bathrooms:</strong> Fixtures, tiles, ventilation, water pressure</li>
          <li><strong>Flooring & Walls:</strong> Condition, cleanliness, damage, paint</li>
          <li><strong>Exterior:</strong> Fence, gates, yard, drainage, parking</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#fff3cd; border-radius:8px;">
        <p style="margin:0;"><strong>Act 220 Compliant:</strong> Inspection process and documentation align with Ghana's Rent Act, 1963 requirements for property condition assessment and dispute documentation.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:3rem 0; text-align:center;">
        <a href="/contact/" style="display:inline-block; padding:1rem 2rem; background:#516784; color:white; text-decoration:none; border-radius:4px; font-weight:600;">Have Questions? Contact Us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
